On Wed, 2026-08-12 at 16:02 +0800, Xiaoyao Li wrote:
> -	if (unlikely(READ_ONCE(to_kvm_tdx(vcpu->kvm)->wait_for_sept_zap)))
> +	if (unlikely(READ_ONCE(to_kvm_tdx(vcpu->kvm)->wait_for_sept_zap))) {
